## PT-158 / PT-155 / PT-156 — REFACTOR + dos INVESTIGATION/FEATURE bloqueados
Date: 2026-07-29
Status: VALIDATION_PENDING (PT-158) · CLOSED (PT-155) · BLOCKED (PT-156)
